@startuml
!include style.iuml
title One review path for deterministic and AI source edits
autonumber
actor Author
participant "Workspace UI" as UI
participant "ChangeReviewService\nC#" as Review
participant "WorkspaceCoordinator\nC#" as W
participant "ProjectRepository" as Repo
UI -> Review : PreviewAsync(ChangeSet based on R)
Review -> W : obtain current revision
Review -> Review : validate spans / expected text / no overlap
Review --> UI : complete diff + preconditions
UI --> Author : show affected files and origin
alt author declines
  Author -> UI : reject
  UI -> Review : discard proposal; no document change
else author accepts
  Author -> UI : accept exact diff
  UI -> Review : AcceptAsync(id, expectedCurrent=R)
  Review -> W : compare current revision to R
  alt stale base or invalid precondition
    Review --> UI : RevisionConflict / InvalidInput; regenerate
  else valid
    Review -> W : apply all edits atomically; create R2 + undo
    W -> Repo : CommitAsync(R2, expectedHead)
    alt persisted
      Repo --> W : committed R2
      W --> UI : applied and saved
    else persistence failure
      Repo --> W : typed storage error
      W --> UI : applied but unsaved; retry / export / undo
    end
  end
end
opt later undo of accepted edits
  Author -> UI : undo
  UI -> Review : UndoAsync(project, expectedCurrent)
  Review -> W : validate inverse; create new revision
  W -> Repo : commit inverse revision with head check
end
note over Review, Repo
Atomic change sets; no edits before acceptance.
Undo never deletes the original revision/history.
end note
@enduml
